Output "take.mp4"
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1200
Set Height 680
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set PlaybackSpeed 1
Set WaitTimeout 90s

Hide
Type "cd app"
Enter
Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Show

Type "opencode"
Enter
Wait+Screen /Ask anything/
Sleep 1s
Type "add a dark mode toggle to the settings page, persisted in localStorage. Follow-up: theme the other pages. When the toggle is done, call handoff for the follow-up."
Enter
Sleep 230s
